  "description": "Ma Beom-Tae, whose dream of becoming a hero was given up on false charges, receives a second chance. He must debut on a survival program and become a hero. But being a K-hero these days isn't as easy as it sounds. Working seven days a week, donating money, constantly feeling guilty, and colleagues going crazy...\n\nWill Ma Beom-Tae be able to keep his dream alive?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
